<title>USA: Magic Hat Beers gets loans for move to Vermont.</title>
<headline>Magic Hat Beers gets loans for move to Vermont.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magic Hat Beers may all be brewed in Vermont soon thanks to loans from the state and federal governments.</p>
<p>Vermont Economic Development Authority and the U.S. Small Business Administration have agreed to a loan package worth almost $1 million for Magic Hat's new brewery in South Burlington.</p>
<p>The new facility has already won the necessary permits. Magic Hat's draft beers are currently brewed in Burlington, but its bottle beer is brewed in Maine. The new brewery will allow the company to consolidate its operations.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
